WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Calm: the mascot’s arcs are thin and blue while long replies keep coming.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The load builds up: orange, thicker arcs, a sweat drop.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Overload (virtual): magenta, thickest arcs, a tired face. Attune lightens the answers.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A checkpoint card, then a rest. The mascot breathes slowly.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
A resume card picks up where you left off. The gauge falls back to blue, the label reads “Recovered”, and reply length and pace return to your defaults. All values are virtual.
